RES osdtriplet
! FOO footprints: beam boundary on a surface range, aperture outline
FOO
SUR S1..3
DAP Y
AZI -90 270 45
GO
! a clear aperture on S1 vignettes the off-axis beams (boundary at r = 4.5)
CIR S1 4.5
FOO
SUR S1
DAP Y
LIS Y
AZI -90 90 30
GO
! an obscuration makes the ray grid the default (central hole on S2)
CIR OBS S2 1.5
FOO
SUR S2
NRD 4
DAP Y
LIS Y
ORI 0.5 0
GO
FOO
SUR SI
BOU Y
AZI 0 360 90
GO
! bad input
FOO
SUR S99
SUR X3
BOU MAYBE
NRD 1
RAR 0.5
AZI 10 5 1
ORI 1
CLE Y
CAN
